f *amountTokenOut* to the actual return value of the `redeem` method, and **SHOULD NOT** return greater than the actual return value of the `redeem` method.\n-- **MUST NOT** revert.\n+- **SHOULD ONLY** revert if burning SY token with the entered parameters is forbidden.\n \n #### Events\n "}]}